WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.515
Seeds don't have feet or wings.

2
00:00:03.516 --> 00:00:09.521
But some seeds can travel.

3
00:00:09.522 --> 00:00:11.835
This is a dandelion seed.

4
00:00:11.836 --> 00:00:15.153
How does this seed travel?

5
00:00:15.154 --> 00:00:19.099
The wind helps this seed travel.

6
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:27.073
"Whee! Farther! Farther!"

7
00:00:27.074 --> 00:00:29.480
This is a willow tree seed.

8
00:00:29.481 --> 00:00:32.550
How does this seed travel?

9
00:00:32.551 --> 00:00:37.019
The river helps this seed travel.

10
00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:45.264
"Watch me float!"

11
00:00:45.265 --> 00:00:47.345
This is a cherry seed.

12
00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:50.479
How does this seed travel?

13
00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:56.092
The bird helps this seed travel.

14
00:00:56.093 --> 00:01:05.124
The bird's poop carries the seed to the ground.

15
00:01:05.125 --> 00:01:07.707
This is a sunflower seed.

16
00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:10.452
How does this seed travel?

17
00:01:10.453 --> 00:01:15.044
The rain helps this seed fall to the ground.

18
00:01:15.045 --> 00:01:23.276
"Look out! Get out of my way!"

19
00:01:23.277 --> 00:01:26.020
This is an impatiens seed.

20
00:01:26.021 --> 00:01:28.922
How does this seed travel?

21
00:01:28.923 --> 00:01:33.239
This seed pops onto the ground.

22
00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:40.012
"I am an acrobat!"

23
00:01:40.013 --> 00:01:42.929
This is a Spanish needles seed.

24
00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:45.910
How does this seed travel?

25
00:01:45.911 --> 00:01:50.133
People help this seed travel.

26
00:01:50.134 --> 00:02:00.957
This seed sticks to the girl's sweater. "Ouch!"

27
00:02:00.958 --> 00:02:06.042
Some seeds are really good travelers.

28
00:02:06.043 --> 00:02:11.662
"Thank you for the ride!"

